###1) Completing the square

The number that will help us complete the square is $\left(\dfrac{\blueD{-20}}{2}\right)^2=\goldD{100}$:

$\begin{align}
x^2\blueD{-20}x&=-19
\\\\
x^2\blueD{-20}x+\goldD{100}&=81&&\text{Add 100.}
\\\\
(x-10)^2&=81&&\text{Factor.}
\end{align}$

[[☃ explanation 1]]
